## switch

Styled switch component built on the zw-switch primitive.

Add command: \`zweb add switch\`
Styled import: \`import { Switch } from '@/components/ui/switch'\`
Install command: \`pnpm add @zeus-web/switch\`
Primitive React import: \`import { Switch } from '@zeus-web/switch/react'\`
Web Component import: \`import '@zeus-web/switch/wc/auto'\`

### Props

- \`checked\` (\`boolean\`): Controlled checked state..
- \`defaultChecked\` (\`boolean\`): Initial checked state..
- \`size\` (\`SwitchSize\`): Switch size.. Values: sm, md, lg. Default: md.
- \`required\` (\`boolean\`): Marks the switch as required..
- \`ariaLabel\` (\`string\`): Accessible label for unlabeled switches..
- \`ariaDescribedby\` (\`string\`): ID reference for additional accessible description..

### Events

- \`checked-change\` / React \`onCheckedChange\`: Emitted when checked state changes.. Detail: checked: boolean, nativeEvent: Event

### Slots

- \`default\`: Label content.

### Styling

Tailwind: yes

Theme tokens:
- bg-primary
- bg-input

Internal selectors:
- [&_[data-slot=switch-track]]
- [&_[data-slot=switch-thumb]]

### AI do

- Use Switch for on/off settings.
- Use Checkbox instead when the field is part of a multi-select list.

### AI do not

- Do not use Switch for submitting an immediate destructive action.

### React styled usage

\`\`\`tsx
