## card

Styled card component family built on zw-card primitives.

Add command: \`zweb add card\`
Styled import: \`import { Card, CardHeader, CardTitle, CardDescription, CardContent, CardFooter } from '@/components/ui/card'\`
Install command: \`pnpm add @zeus-web/card\`
Primitive React import: \`import { Card, CardHeader, CardTitle, CardDescription, CardContent, CardFooter } from '@zeus-web/card/react'\`
Web Component import: \`import '@zeus-web/card/wc/auto'\`

### Props

- No public props documented.

### Events

- No public events documented.

### Slots

- \`default\`: Card child components.

### Styling

Tailwind: yes

Theme tokens:
- bg-card
- text-card-foreground
- border

Internal selectors:
- [data-slot=card-root]
- [data-slot=card-header]
- [data-slot=card-title]
- [data-slot=card-content]

### AI do

- Use Card for grouped content containers.
- Use CardHeader + CardTitle for titles.
- Use CardContent for the main body.
- Use CardFooter for actions.

### AI do not

- Do not use Card inside another Card.
- Do not place interactive elements in CardDescription.

### React styled usage

\`\`\`tsx
import { Card, CardContent, CardDescription, CardHeader, CardTitle } from '@/components/ui/card'

export function Example() {
  return (
    <Card>
      <CardHeader>
        <CardTitle>Title</CardTitle>
        <CardDescription>Description</CardDescription>
      </CardHeader>
      <CardContent>Content</CardContent>
    </Card>
  )
}
\`\`\`

